# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum machine learning {#quantum-machine-learning}"
msgstr "Pembelajaran mesin kuantum {#quantum-machine-learning}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quantum machine learning (QML) is an emerging field that combines quantum computing and machine learning to explore new ways of analyzing data, \n"
"recognizing patterns, and solving complex computational problems. It applies concepts from quantum mechanics to develop quantum algorithms and machine\n"
"learning models that can run on quantum computers or integrate quantum and classical computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pembelajaran mesin kuantum (QML) ialah bidang yang sedang berkembang yang menggabungkan pengkomputeran kuantum dan pembelajaran mesin untuk meneroka cara baharu menganalisis data, \n"
"mengenal pasti corak, dan menyelesaikan masalah pengiraan yang kompleks. Ia menerapkan konsep daripada mekanik kuantum untuk membangunkan algoritma kuantum dan model pembelajaran\n"
"mesin yang boleh dijalankan pada komputer kuantum atau menggabungkan pengkomputeran kuantum dan klasik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Research in QML includes quantum neural networks, quantum kernel methods, and hybrid quantum-classical algorithms, which use classical computers to \n"
"optimize models while quantum processors perform specific computations. Although QML might offer advantages for certain tasks, practical benefits over \n"
"classical machine learning remain an active area of research.\n"
msgstr ""
"Penyelidikan dalam QML merangkumi rangkaian neural kuantum, kaedah kernel kuantum, dan algoritma hibrid kuantum-klasik, yang menggunakan komputer klasik untuk \n"
"mengoptimumkan model manakala pemproses kuantum melaksanakan pengiraan tertentu. Walaupun QML mungkin menawarkan kelebihan untuk tugas tertentu, manfaat praktikal berbanding \n"
"pembelajaran mesin klasik masih merupakan bidang penyelidikan yang aktif.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A common workflow trains a model mostly on classical hardware, and then uses a quantum processor for a targeted subroutine, such as optimizing the diversity of an ensemble of learners or evaluating a quantum kernel, where quantum effects might provide an advantage over a purely classical approach. With this hybrid structure, you can apply quantum resources to the part of the problem where they can have the most effect, while keeping most of a machine learning pipeline, such as data preprocessing and large-scale training, on classical infrastructure. The application functions on this page follow this pattern: one for classification tasks, and one for feature extraction.\n"
msgstr "Aliran kerja yang lazim melatih model terutamanya pada perkakasan klasik, kemudian menggunakan pemproses kuantum untuk subrutin tertentu, seperti mengoptimumkan kepelbagaian ensembel pelajar atau menilai kernel kuantum, di mana kesan kuantum mungkin memberikan kelebihan berbanding pendekatan klasik semata-mata. Dengan struktur hibrid ini, anda boleh menggunakan sumber kuantum pada bahagian masalah yang paling banyak mendapat manfaat, sambil mengekalkan sebahagian besar saluran paip pembelajaran mesin, seperti prapemprosesan data dan latihan berskala besar, pada infrastruktur klasik. Application functions pada halaman ini mengikuti corak ini: satu untuk tugas pengelasan, dan satu untuk pengekstrakan ciri.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"application-functions\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Application functions for quantum machine learning {#application-functions-for-quantum-machine-learning}"
msgstr "Application functions untuk pembelajaran mesin kuantum {#application-functions-for-quantum-machine-learning}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following quantum functions apply this hybrid approach to machine learning tasks, and use quantum hardware at different points of a pipeline:\n"
msgstr "Fungsi kuantum berikut menerapkan pendekatan hibrid ini pada tugas pembelajaran mesin, dan menggunakan perkakasan kuantum pada titik yang berbeza dalam saluran paip:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Singularity Machine Learning - Classification** solves binary classification problems. You provide your own training data, and the function classically trains an ensemble of learners, then uses a quantum algorithm to optimize that ensemble for diversity and generalization, before returning predictions on new data.\n"
msgstr "**Singularity Machine Learning - Classification** menyelesaikan masalah pengelasan binari. Anda menyediakan data latihan anda sendiri, dan fungsi ini melatih ensembel pelajar secara klasik, kemudian menggunakan algoritma kuantum untuk mengoptimumkan ensembel tersebut bagi kepelbagaian dan generalisasi, sebelum memulangkan ramalan pada data baharu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Rimay Quantum Feature Extraction** adds a preprocessing step to an existing machine learning pipeline. You provide classical tabular data, and the function returns quantum-transformed features generated on quantum hardware. You can use these features on their own, or combine them with your original features, to train a classical model of your choice.\n"
msgstr "**Rimay Quantum Feature Extraction** menambah langkah prapemprosesan kepada saluran paip pembelajaran mesin sedia ada. Anda menyediakan data jadual klasik, dan fungsi ini memulangkan ciri yang diubah secara kuantum yang dijana pada perkakasan kuantum. Anda boleh menggunakan ciri ini sendiri, atau menggabungkannya dengan ciri asal anda, untuk melatih model klasik pilihan anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"IBM Quantum&reg; Functions are a beta feature available only to IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, and On-Prem (through the IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users. Refer to [Set up IBM Quantum Functions](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) for instructions on getting access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nota\">\n"
"IBM Quantum&reg; Functions ialah ciri beta yang hanya tersedia untuk pengguna Pelan Premium IBM Quantum, Pelan Flex, dan Pelan On-Prem (melalui API IBM Quantum Platform). Rujuk [Sediakan IBM Quantum Functions](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) untuk arahan mendapatkan akses.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

